%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 68a562a3113328847ae19c58e2cf3a27, type: 3}
  m_Name: StringTable
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StringTable
  entries:
  - key: FirstMeleePassive/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uBD88\uAD74\uC758 \uC758\uC9C0"
    en: Indomitable Will
  - key: FirstMeleePassive/tooltip.description
    ko: "{cooldownTime}\uCD08\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uB2E4\uC74C \uACF5\uACA9\uC774 {dmg}\uC758
      \uCD94\uAC00 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD788\uACE0 \uCD5C\uB300 \uCCB4\uB825\uC758
      {healPercent}%\uB97C <style=heal>\uD68C\uBCF5</style>\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC801\uC911
      \uC2DC \uC7AC\uC0AC\uC6A9 \uB300\uAE30\uC2DC\uAC04\uC774 {hitCooldownReduction}\uCD08
      \uAC10\uC18C\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Every {cooldownTime}s, your next attack deals {dmg} bonus damage and <style=heal>restores</style>
      {healPercent}% of max HP. On hit, the cooldown is reduced by {hitCooldownReduction}s.
  - key: FirstMeleeMainSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uC9C4\uACA9\uC758 \uBC29\uD328"
    en: Advancing Shield
  - key: FirstMeleeMainSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "Q \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: Q Skill
  - key: FirstMeleeMainSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uCD5C\uB300 {maxActiveDuration}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 \uB3CC\uC9C4\uD558\uBA70
      \uC801\uC744 \uBC00\uC5B4\uB0B4\uACE0, {tickInterval}\uCD08\uB9C8\uB2E4 {dmg}\uC758
      \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Charge for up to {maxActiveDuration}s, pushing enemies back and dealing {dmg}
      damage every {tickInterval}s.
  - key: FirstMeleeSubSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uC218\uD638\uC790\uC758 \uC758\uC9C0"
    en: Guardian's Will
  - key: FirstMeleeSubSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "E \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: E Skill
  - key: FirstMeleeSubSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC804\uBC29\uC758 \uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uB9C9\uC73C\uBA74 \uBC18\uACA9\uD558\uC5EC
      {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBC18\uACA9 \uC911\uC5D0\uB294
      \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uBB34\uC2DC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Blocking a frontal attack triggers a counterattack that deals {dmg} damage.
      You ignore damage while counterattacking.
  - key: FirstMeleeInterruptSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uB2E8\uC8C4\uC758 \uBC29\uD328"
    en: Shield of Condemnation
  - key: FirstMeleeInterruptSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "\uC6B0\uD074\uB9AD \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: Right-Click Skill
  - key: FirstMeleeInterruptSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC804\uBC29\uC5D0 {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uAC04\uD30C \uC131\uACF5 \uC2DC \uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uB04A\uACE0 \uCDE8\uC57D
      \uC0C1\uD0DC\uB85C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uBA70, \uCDE8\uC57D\uD55C \uC801\uC740 \uB4A4\uB85C
      \uBC00\uC5B4\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Deals {dmg} damage in front of you. A successful Interrupt cancels the enemy's
      attack and leaves it Vulnerable; Vulnerable enemies are knocked back.
  - key: FirstMeleeUltimateSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uCD5C\uD6C4\uC758 \uC2EC\uD310"
    en: Final Judgment
  - key: FirstMeleeUltimateSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "\uAD81\uADF9\uAE30"
    en: Ultimate
  - key: FirstMeleeUltimateSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC9C0\uC815\uD55C \uC704\uCE58\uC5D0 \uC2EC\uD310\uC758 \uC77C\uACA9\uC744
      \uB0B4\uB824\uCCD0 {dmg}\uC758 \uAD11\uC5ED \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Bring down a strike of judgment on the target location, dealing {dmg} area
      damage.
  - key: GunnerHeatData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uC784\uACC4 \uCD9C\uB825"
    en: Critical Output
  - key: GunnerHeatData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uAE30\uBCF8 \uACF5\uACA9\uC73C\uB85C \uC5F4\uAE30\uAC00 \uC313\uC5EC \uD53C\uD574\uAC00
      \uC99D\uAC00\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC5F4\uAE30\uAC00 {maxHeat}\uC5D0 \uB3C4\uB2EC\uD558\uBA74
      <style=overheat>\uACFC\uC5F4</style>\uB418\uC5B4 \uAE30\uBCF8 \uACF5\uACA9\uC774
      \uC7A0\uAE41\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\n\uAE30\uBCF8 \uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uBA48\uCD94\uBA74
      {coolDelay}\uCD08 \uD6C4 \uB0C9\uAC01\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uACFC\uC5F4\uC740
      \uC5F4\uAE30\uAC00 \uBAA8\uB450 \uC2DD\uC73C\uBA74 \uD574\uC81C\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: 'Basic attacks build Heat, increasing damage. At {maxHeat} Heat you <style=overheat>Overheat</style>
      and basic attacks are locked.


      Stop basic attacks to start cooling after
      {coolDelay}s. Overheat ends once all Heat has cooled.'
  - key: GunnerChargeLaserData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uC9D1\uC18D \uD3EC\uACA9"
    en: Focused Blast
  - key: GunnerChargeLaserData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "Q \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: Q Skill
  - key: GunnerChargeLaserData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC801\uC744 \uAD00\uD1B5\uD558\uB294 \uB808\uC774\uC800\uB85C {dmg}\uC758
      \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uCDA9\uC804\uD560\uC218\uB85D
      \uD53C\uD574\uC640 \uC0AC\uAC70\uB9AC\uAC00 \uC99D\uAC00\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\n\uACBD\uB85C\uC0C1\uC758
      \uC544\uAD70\uC5D0\uAC8C {shieldDuration}\uCD08\uAC04 \uAE30\uBCF8 {shieldAmount}\uC758
      <style=shield>\uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9</style>\uC744 \uBD80\uC5EC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uACFC\uC5F4 \uB2E8\uACC4\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uD53C\uD574\uC640 \uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9\uB7C9\uC774
      \uC99D\uAC00\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: 'Fire a piercing laser that deals {dmg} damage. Charging longer increases
      damage and range.


      Allies in its path gain a base {shieldAmount} <style=shield>shield</style>
      for {shieldDuration}s. Damage and shield amount increase with your Overheat
      stage.'
  - key: GunnerCoolBackstepData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uAE34\uAE09 \uB0C9\uAC01"
    en: Emergency Cooling
  - key: GunnerCoolBackstepData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "E \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: E Skill
  - key: GunnerCoolBackstepData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uB4A4\uB85C {distance}m \uB3C4\uC57D\uD558\uBA70 \uC5F4\uAE30\uB97C \uBAA8\uB450
      \uC81C\uAC70\uD558\uACE0 <style=overheat>\uACFC\uC5F4</style>\uC744 \uD574\uC81C\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Leap back {distance}m, clearing all Heat and ending <style=overheat>Overheat</style>.
  - key: GunnerInterruptData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uCDA9\uACA9 \uBC29\uCD9C"
    en: Shock Burst
  - key: GunnerInterruptData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "\uC6B0\uD074\uB9AD \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: Right-Click Skill
  - key: GunnerInterruptData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC804\uBC29\uC5D0 {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD788\uACE0 \uB4A4\uB85C
      \uBB3C\uB7EC\uB0A9\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uAC04\uD30C \uC131\uACF5 \uC2DC \uACF5\uACA9\uC744
      \uB04A\uACE0 \uCDE8\uC57D \uC0C1\uD0DC\uB85C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uBA70, \uCDE8\uC57D\uD55C
      \uC801\uC740 \uB4A4\uB85C \uBC00\uC5B4\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Deals {dmg} damage in front of you and steps back. A successful Interrupt
      cancels the enemy's attack and leaves it Vulnerable; Vulnerable enemies are
      knocked back.
  - key: GunnerTrackingLaserData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uADA4\uB3C4 \uCD94\uC801\uD3EC"
    en: Orbital Tracker
  - key: GunnerTrackingLaserData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "\uAD81\uADF9\uAE30"
    en: Ultimate
  - key: GunnerTrackingLaserData/tooltip.description
    ko: "{laserDuration}\uCD08\uAC04 \uC801\uC744 \uCD94\uC801\uD558\uB294 \uB808\uC774\uC800\uB85C
      {damageInterval}\uCD08\uB9C8\uB2E4 {dmg}\uC758 \uAD11\uC5ED \uD53C\uD574\uB97C
      \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uACFC\uC5F4 \uB2E8\uACC4\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uD53C\uD574\uAC00
      \uC99D\uAC00\uD558\uBA70, \uB300\uC0C1 \uC0AC\uB9DD \uC2DC \uB2E4\uB978 \uC801\uC744
      \uCD94\uC801\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Fire a laser that tracks enemies for {laserDuration}s, dealing {dmg} area
      damage every {damageInterval}s. Damage increases with your Overheat stage,
      and it retargets another enemy when the target dies.
  - key: AssassinStateData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uC0AC\uB0E5 \uBCF8\uB2A5"
    en: Hunter's Instinct
  - key: AssassinStateData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uD6C4\uBC29 \uACF5\uACA9\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uAC00 \uC99D\uAC00\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uC77C\uBC18 \uC0C1\uD0DC\uC5D0\uC11C \uAE30\uBCF8 \uACF5\uACA9\xB7Q\xB7\uAC15\uD0C0
      \uC801\uC911 \uC2DC \uBD84\uB178\uB97C \uC5BB\uC73C\uBA70, \uBD84\uB178 {minTransformRage}
      \uC774\uC0C1\uC774\uBA74 \uBCC0\uC2E0\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\n\uBCC0\uC2E0
      \uC911\uC5D0\uB294 \uBD84\uB178\uB97C \uC18C\uBAA8\uD558\uACE0 \uBAA8\uB4E0
      \uACF5\uACA9\uC5D0 \uBC31\uC5B4\uD0DD \uD6A8\uACFC\uAC00 \uC801\uC6A9\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: 'Attacks from behind deal more damage. In normal form, landing basic attacks,
      Q, or Power Strikes grants Rage; at {minTransformRage}+ Rage you can transform.


      While
      transformed, Rage drains and every attack counts as a Back Attack.'
  - key: AssassinDashStrikeSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC790 \uB3CC\uD30C"
    en: Shadow Breach
  - key: AssassinDashStrikeSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "Q \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: Q Skill
  - key: AssassinDashStrikeSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "{dashDistance}m \uB3CC\uC9C4\uD558\uBA70 \uACBD\uB85C\uC0C1\uC758 \uC801\uC5D0\uAC8C
      {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC801\uC744 \uD1B5\uACFC\uD558\uBA70
      \uB3CC\uC9C4 \uC911 \uC800\uC9C0\uBD88\uAC00 \uC0C1\uD0DC\uAC00 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Dash {dashDistance}m, dealing {dmg} damage to enemies in your path. You pass
      through enemies and are Unstoppable while dashing.
  - key: AssassinEnhanceSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uC0AC\uB0E5\uAFBC\uC758 \uCE7C\uB0A0"
    en: Hunter's Blade
  - key: AssassinEnhanceSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "E \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: E Skill
  - key: AssassinEnhanceSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uB2E4\uC74C \uAE30\uBCF8 \uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uAC15\uD654\uD574 {dmg}\uC758
      \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC801\uC911 \uC2DC \uB354 \uB9CE\uC740
      \uBD84\uB178\uB97C \uC5BB\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Empower your next basic attack to deal {dmg} damage. Landing it grants extra
      Rage.
  - key: AssassinCircleStrikeSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uCE7C\uB0A0 \uD3ED\uD48D"
    en: Blade Storm
  - key: AssassinCircleStrikeSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "E \uC2A4\uD0AC \xB7 \uBCC0\uC2E0"
    en: "E Skill \xB7 Transformed"
  - key: AssassinCircleStrikeSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC6D0\uD615 \uBC94\uC704\uC758 \uC801\uC744 {hitCount}\uD68C \uBCA0\uC5B4
      \uD0C0\uACA9\uB9C8\uB2E4 {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uACF5\uACA9 \uC911 \uBB34\uC801 \uC0C1\uD0DC\uAC00 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Slash enemies in a circular area {hitCount} times, dealing {dmg} damage per
      hit. You are invulnerable while attacking.
  - key: AssassinTransformSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uD574\uBC29\uB41C \uBCF8\uB2A5"
    en: Unleashed Instinct
  - key: AssassinTransformSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "\uAD81\uADF9\uAE30"
    en: Ultimate
  - key: AssassinTransformSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uBD84\uB178\uB97C \uC18C\uBAA8\uD558\uBA70 \uBCC0\uC2E0\uD574 \uAE30\uBCF8
      \uACF5\uACA9\uACFC Q\xB7E\uB97C \uAC15\uD654\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBD84\uB178\uAC00
      \uC18C\uC9C4\uB418\uBA74 \uD574\uC81C\uB418\uBA70, \uC7AC\uC0AC\uC6A9\uD574
      \uD574\uC81C\uD558\uBA74 \uB0A8\uC740 \uBD84\uB178\uB97C \uBCF4\uC874\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Transform by consuming Rage, empowering your basic attack, Q, and E. Ends
      when Rage runs out; reactivate to revert early and keep your remaining Rage.
  - key: AssassinTransformedDashStrikeSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uAD11\uB780\uC758 \uB3CC\uD30C"
    en: Frenzied Breach
  - key: AssassinTransformedDashStrikeSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "Q \uC2A4\uD0AC \xB7 \uBCC0\uC2E0"
    en: "Q Skill \xB7 Transformed"
  - key: AssassinTransformedDashStrikeSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "{dashDistance}m \uB3CC\uC9C4\uD558\uBA70 \uACBD\uB85C\uC0C1\uC758 \uC801\uC5D0\uAC8C
      {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC801\uC744 \uD1B5\uACFC\uD558\uBA70
      \uB3CC\uC9C4 \uC911 \uC800\uC9C0\uBD88\uAC00 \uC0C1\uD0DC\uAC00 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uC801\uC911 \uC2DC \uC7AC\uC0AC\uC6A9 \uB300\uAE30\uC2DC\uAC04\uC774 {hitCooldownReduction}\uCD08
      \uAC10\uC18C\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Dash {dashDistance}m, dealing {dmg} damage to enemies in your path. You pass
      through enemies and are Unstoppable while dashing. On hit, the cooldown is
      reduced by {hitCooldownReduction}s.
  - key: AssassinInterruptSkillData/tooltip.displayName
    ko: "\uD30C\uACE0\uB4DC\uB294 \uCE7C\uB0A0"
    en: Piercing Blade
  - key: AssassinInterruptSkillData/tooltip.subtitle
    ko: "\uC6B0\uD074\uB9AD \uC2A4\uD0AC"
    en: Right-Click Skill
  - key: AssassinInterruptSkillData/tooltip.description
    ko: "\uC804\uBC29\uC5D0 {dmg}\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uAC04\uD30C \uC131\uACF5 \uC2DC \uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uB04A\uACE0 \uCDE8\uC57D
      \uC0C1\uD0DC\uB85C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uBA70, \uCDE8\uC57D\uD55C \uC801\uC740 \uB4A4\uB85C
      \uBC00\uC5B4\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: Deals {dmg} damage in front of you. A successful Interrupt cancels the enemy's
      attack and leaves it Vulnerable; Vulnerable enemies are knocked back.
  - key: UI.Result.Character
    ko: "\uCE90\uB9AD\uD130"
    en: Character
  - key: UI.Result.Damage
    ko: "\uB370\uBBF8\uC9C0"
    en: Damage
  - key: UI.Result.Kills
    ko: "\uCC98\uCE58"
    en: Kills
  - key: UI.Result.Counters
    ko: "\uAC04\uD30C"
    en: Interrupts
  - key: UI.Result.Deaths
    ko: "\uC0AC\uB9DD"
    en: Deaths
  - key: UI.AssassinHUD.EnhancedReady
    ko: "E \uAC15\uD654 \uC900\uBE44"
    en: E Ready
  - key: UI.AssassinHUD.TransformRemaining
    ko: "\uBCC0\uC2E0 {time}"
    en: Transform {time}
  - key: UI.AssassinHUD.TransformReleasable
    ko: "\uBCC0\uC2E0 {time} \xB7 R \uD574\uC81C \uAC00\uB2A5"
    en: "Transform {time} \xB7 R to Revert"
  - key: UI.AssassinHUD.TransformEndPending
    ko: "\uBCC0\uC2E0 \uC885\uB8CC \uB300\uAE30"
    en: Transform Ending
  - key: UI.GunnerHeat.Stage
    ko: "\uACFC\uC5F4 {stage}\uB2E8\uACC4"
    en: Heat Lv.{stage}
  - key: UI.GunnerHeat.Overheated
    ko: "\uACFC\uC5F4!"
    en: Overheated!
  - key: UI.Interact.Prompt
    ko: "\uC0C1\uD638 \uC791\uC6A9"
    en: Interact
  - key: UI.Overhead.PlayerLabel
    ko: P{n}
    en: P{n}
  - key: UI.Unit.Seconds
    ko: "{sec}\uCD08"
    en: '{sec}s'
  - key: UI.Loading.Preparing
    ko: Preparing...
    en: Preparing...
  - key: UI.Loading.Loading
    ko: Loading...
    en: Loading...
  - key: UI.Loading.WaitingForPlayers
    ko: Waiting for players...
    en: Waiting for players...
  - key: UI.Loading.Activating
    ko: Starting...
    en: Starting...
  - key: UI.Loading.StandBy
    ko: Stand by...
    en: Stand by...
  - key: UI.SkillTooltip.ShiftHint
    ko: "\uC790\uC138\uD55C \uC815\uBCF4\uB97C \uBCF4\uB824\uBA74 [Shift] \uD0A4\uB97C
      \uB204\uB974\uC138\uC694"
    en: Press [Shift] for details
  - key: UI.SkillTooltip.Error
    ko: "[\uC624\uB958: {error}]"
    en: '[Error: {error}]'
  - key: UI.SkillTooltip.PassiveBadge
    ko: Passive
    en: Passive
  - key: UI.Result.Cleared
    ko: CLEAR
    en: CLEAR
  - key: UI.Result.Failed
    ko: FAILED
    en: FAILED
  - key: UI.Result.Aborted
    ko: ABORTED
    en: ABORTED
  - key: UI.Result.Survival
    ko: "\uC0DD\uC874 \uC2DC\uAC04  {time}"
    en: Survival Time  {time}
  - key: UI.Result.PlayerSlot
